Description: Ultra-lightweight native telemetry overlay
 BareStats is an unprivileged, ultra-lightweight telemetry overlay delivering
 real-time CPU, GPU, VRAM, RAM, and network throughput at 0.00% idle duty cycle.
 .
 Features include dynamic multi-GPU auto-targeting, custom 2D matrix grids,
 distributed AI inference monitoring, and zero-overhead hardware polling.
 .
 Developed by Chakrank.
